h>3</Month><Day>4</Day><Hour>7</Hour><Minute>15</Minute></PubMedPubDate><PubMedPubDate PubStatus="pubmed"><Year>2026</Year><Month>3</Month><Day>4</Day><Hour>7</Hour><Minute>15</Minute></PubMedPubDate><PubMedPubDate PubStatus="entrez"><Year>2026</Year><Month>3</Month><Day>4</Day><Hour>4</Hour><Minute>43</Minute></PubMedPubDate></History><PublicationStatus>aheadofprint</PublicationStatus><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">41778291</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1111/hae.70248</ArticleId></ArticleIdList><ReferenceList><Title>References</Title><Reference><Citation>J. Lyu, Y. Xie, M. Sun, and L. Zhang, &#x201c;Clinical Evidence and GRADE Assessment for Breviscapine Injection (DengZhanHuaSu) in Patients With Acute Cerebral Infarction,&#x201d; Journal of Ethnopharmacology 262 (2020): 113137.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>J. Wu, A. D. Lu, L. P. Zhang, Y. X. Zuo, and Y. P. Jia, &#x201c;[Study of Clinical Outcome and Prognosis in Pediatric Core Binding Factor&#x2010;Acute myeloid leukemia],&#x201d; Zhonghua xue ye xue za zhi = Zhonghua xueyexue zazhi 40 (2019): 52&#x2013;57.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Z. Majid, F. Tahir, J. Ahmed, T. Bin Arif, and A. Haq, &#x201c;Protein C Deficiency as a Risk Factor for Stroke in Young Adults: A Review,&#x201d; Cureus 12 (2020): e7472.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>V. Schuster, B. H&#xfc;gle, and K. Tefs, &#x201c;Plasminogen Deficiency,&#x201d; Journal of Thrombosis and Haemostasis 5 (2007): 2315&#x2013;2322.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>V. Schuster and S. Seregard, &#x201c;Ligneous Conjunctivitis,&#x201d; Survey of Ophthalmology 48 (2003): 369&#x2013;388.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>N. Aoki, M. Moroi, Y. Sakata, N. Yoshida, and M. Matsuda, &#x201c;Abnormal Plasminogen. A Hereditary Molecular Abnormality Found in a Patient With Recurrent Thrombosis,&#x201d; The Journal of Clinical Investigation 61 (1978): 1186&#x2013;1195.</Citation></Reference><Reference><C