ork in Schizophrenia Patients With Auditory Verbal Hallucinations Following 1 Hz rTMS Treatment, NeuroImage: Clinical. (2023) 40, https://doi.org/10.1016/j.nicl.2023.103546, 103546.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Peng D., Shi F., and Shen T., et al.Altered Brain Network Modules Induce Helplessness in Major Depressive Disorder, Journal of Affective Disorders. (2014) 168, 21&#x2013;29, https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jad.2014.05.061, 2-s2.0-84904576179.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Hiroshima S., Anei R., Murakami N., and Kamada K., Functional Localization of the Supplementary Motor Area, Neurologia Medico-Chirurgica. (2014) 54, no. 7, 511&#x2013;520, https://doi.org/10.2176/nmc.oa2012-0321, 2-s2.0-84904397647.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Zhang R., Zhang L., and Wei S., et al.Increased Amygdala-Paracentral Lobule/Precuneus Functional Connectivity Associated With Patients With Mood Disorder and Suicidal Behavior, Frontiers in Human Neuroscience. (2021) 14, https://doi.org/10.3389/fnhum.2020.585664, 585664.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Sydnor V. J., Larsen B., and Bassett D. S., Neurodevelopment of the Association Cortices: Patterns, Mechanisms, and Implications for Psychopathology, Neuron. (2021) 109, no. 18, 2820&#x2013;2846, https://doi.org/10.1016/j.neuron.2021.06.016.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Conway B. R., The Organization and Operation of Inferior Temporal Cortex, Annual Review of Vision Science. (2018) 4, no. 1, 381&#x2013;402, https://doi.org/10.1146/annurev-vision-091517-034202, 2-s2.0-85053371661.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Herath P., Kinomura S., and Roland P. E., Visual Recognition: Evidence for Two Distinctive Mechanisms From a PET Study, Human Brain Mapping. (2001) 12, no. 2, 110&#x2013;119.</Citation></Reference><Reference><Citation>Lin Y.-H., Young I. M., and Conner A. K., Anatomy and White Matter Connections of the Inferior Temporal Gyrus, World Neurosurgery. (2020) 143, e